From: ImpulseROM <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the Screen resolution selector available

The S24 FE build also folds SecScreenResolutionSingleChoiceController.getAvailabilityStatus()
to 3 (UNSUPPORTED_ON_DEVICE), which hides the selector even without the removal in
ScreenResolutionFragment. Return 0 (AVAILABLE) on QHD devices.
---

--- a/smali_classes5/com/samsung/android/settings/display/controller/SecScreenResolutionSingleChoiceController.smali
+++ b/smali_classes5/com/samsung/android/settings/display/controller/SecScreenResolutionSingleChoiceController.smali
@@ -522,7 +522,7 @@
 
     sget-object p0, Lcom/samsung/android/settings/Rune;->COMMON_CONFIG_PACKAGE_NAME_SMART_MANAGER:Ljava/lang/String;
 
-    const/4 p0, 0x3
+    const/4 p0, 0x0
 
     return p0
 .end method
